          "heading": "Fiji's 2026 Nations Championship schedule builds to France in Round 4",
          "body": "Fiji's next assignment is the trip to France on the calendar. The log has them winless from three outings, with 49 points scored and 145 conceded for a difference of -96. Against that backdrop, the trip to France is a real test of where the side stands. Their most recent result was a 34-28 win over Japan."
