          "heading": "Galthié names Regis Montagne among five new faces in 42-man France squad",
          "body": "Fabien Galthié has added five players to France's Nations Championship squad, taking the group to 42. Clermont prop Regis Montagne is in as cover for Bayonne's Tevita Tatafu, while Montpellier lock Florian Verhaeghe, Toulouse prop Rodrigue Neti and uncapped Clermont centre Leon Darricarrere complete the changes. The additions come ahead of the Springboks' visit to the Stade de France and the Argentina test that follows."
