          "kicker": "Contract news",
          "heading": "Ulster re-sign Jacob Stockdale, Nick Timoney and Tom O'Toole until 2030",
          "body": "Ulster have tied down five senior players, including four Ireland internationals, on contracts running until at least 2030. James Hume, Tom O'Toole, Jacob Stockdale and Nick Timoney have all won Test caps, and Ethan McIlroy has been drafted into Ireland's November squad. General manager Rory Best said Ulster were \"very pleased to have secured the futures\" of the five, who have a combined 650 appearances between them and all came through the club's youth ranks."
        },
