      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Anniversary tribute",
          "heading": "Italy mark ten years since Florence win over Springboks with Turin tribute",
          "body": "The FIR has laid on a pre-match tribute to the 19 November 2016 win at Florence's Artemio Franchi, Italy's first historic triumph over the Springboks. Former Azzurri from that day will receive awards from federation president, after a speech from some players who featured ten years ago. Proceeds from a charity auction of Nicola Russo's TOH artwork and shirts signed by both squads go to the INOC Candiolo cancer institute, and ticket holders can book a free male cancer check."
