    },
    "391": {
      "date": "2026-11-05",
      "edition": "Thursday 5 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Tandy set to pair Llewellyn and James in midfield against Japan",
          "body": "WalesOnline understands Tandy will drop the dual-playmaker approach favoured by attack coach Matt Sherratt, with Sam Costelow at fly-half and Max Llewellyn and Eddie James expected to form the midfield partnership. Llewellyn has started at inside centre only once for Wales, against England in a 2023 warm-up, while Tandy has said that James is \"more of a 13 who can play 12\" in the Wales set-up. Louie Hennessey is set to be named among the replacements."
        },
        {
