          "kicker": "Opposition selection",
          "heading": "Steve Tandy set to start Sam Costelow at fly-half against Japan",
          "body": "Japan will face a reshaped Welsh midfield if the reports hold: WalesOnline understands Sam Costelow is poised to take the No. 10 shirt, with Max Llewellyn and Eddie James set to form the centres, ending the second-playmaker approach attack coach Matt Sherratt has favoured. Wales head coach Steve Tandy has said he sees James as more of a 13 who can play 12. Louie Hennessey is set to be named among the replacements, and Dafydd Jenkins is an injury concern, subject to getting through training."
