          "heading": "Tyrel Lomax dropped from tour squad; Jason Ryan backs scrum improvement",
          "body": "All Blacks coach Dave Rennie has cited the injury Lomax played through against South Africa, and the tighthead missed both Bledisloe Cup Tests. Scrum coach Jason Ryan says the set-piece began turning the tide late in the Springboks series and carried that into the Wallaby Tests; Scott Barrett has added power on the tighthead side. Uncapped prop Saula Ma'u gets his chance, while Ethan De Groot returns to fitness and will compete with George Bower for the loosehead jersey."
        },
